The version description shall identify atc_tower 0.1.0, dated 2026-11-20, as the rebar3 release of the Tower CSCI together with AtcTower.tla, the refinement mapping, the StrictDoc sources, and the HTML generated under reqs/html. It shall record the TLC result of 414 distinct states with no invariant error and the Common Test result of 15 passing tests. Acceptance is a version record that names those artifacts and results and does not claim certification authority approval.
